{"unit_id":"hufangd-2019__dsh-latex2office#card-zh","repo":"hufangd-2019/dsh-latex2office","commit":"006c38d44f1eaf7ab8b6e48e604d51a24110de4f","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-latex2office 是面向 DSH 的 LaTeX 公式办公文档工具插件，会向 DSH 工具注册表加入插入、生成和预览三项工具。它可将公式插入现有 Word 或 PowerPoint 文件，按文档位置定位，批量处理并支持公式编号；也能从公式列表新建 DOCX，或先渲染 PNG 预览。DOCX 默认生成可编辑的 OMML 公式，PPTX 默认使用图片。适合需要把 LaTeX 数学内容整理进 Office 文档的 DSH 用户。宿主机需要 Python 及文档库、pandoc；图片渲染还需要 LibreOffice。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:341-400","engine/engine.py:66-73","cordis.patch.yml:1-12"]}
{"unit_id":"hufangd-2019__dsh-latex2office#card-en","repo":"hufangd-2019/dsh-latex2office","commit":"006c38d44f1eaf7ab8b6e48e604d51a24110de4f","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-latex2office adds DSH tools to insert LaTeX formulas into Word or PowerPoint, create DOCX files, and preview formulas as PNG images. It supports positions, batches, and numbering. DOCX uses editable OMML; PPTX defaults to images. Python, pandoc, and LibreOffice for image rendering are required.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:341-400","engine/engine.py:66-73","cordis.patch.yml:1-12"]}
